  "verseCount": 41,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOS 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo Adonisedeki omukama wa Yerusalemu yahuliire okwo Yoshua akwete Ai, n'okwo agisilikiize kimoi, akahulira okwo agikozire n'omukama wayo nk'okwo yakozire Yeriko n'omukama wayo, n'okwo abanyansi ba Gibeoni bagizire emirembe na Isiraeli mara bakatura nabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "batina muno aha rw'okuba Gibeoni kikaba kili kimoiho omu bigo ebihango. Gibeoni ekaba eli mpango kukira Ai, n'abashaija bamwo bona bali manzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo Adonisedeki omukama wa Yerusalemu atuma ahali Hohamu omukama wa Heburoni, n'ahali Piramu omukama wa Yarimuti, n'ahali Yafia omukama wa Lakishi, n'ahali Debiri omukama wa Egiloni nagamba ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwije kunu, munjune tutere aba Gibeoni kuba bakozire endagano na Yoshua n'Abaisiraeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho abakama bontanu b'Abaamori: Owa Yerusalemu, owa Heburoni, owa Yarimuti, owa Lakishi n'owa Egiloni, bahikanisa hamoi amahe gabo gona, baija nago basisira bolekeire Gibeoni, bagirashanisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ba Gibeoni batuma ahali Yoshua omu rusisira rwa Giligali, bati, “Otanaga bairu bawe; yanguha oturokore, otujune; aha rw'okuba abakama bona b'Abaamori ab'omu mabanga bahurwire kututabalira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo Yoshua aruga Giligali, agenda n'eihe lyona n'abaisherukare emanzi batabuziremu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama amugambira ati, “Otabatina, ahakuba nabanagire omu mikono yawe, taliho mushaija arakwehanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Yoshua aruga Giligali ekiro kyona, ababunda kibandagara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama abayagayagya aha rw'okutina Abaisiraeli, Abaisiraeli babaitira Gibeoni, bababinga babarabya ogw'akashozi ka Betihoroni, bagenda nibabaita kulemwa kuhika Azeka na Makeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo balikwiruka Abaisiraeli nibasoka akashozi ka Betihoroni, Omukama abateza amabare gahango g'enjura kulemwa kugoba Azeka, bafa. Abaisirwe orubare bhakaba bali bangi kushaga ab'Abaisiraeli baisize embanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiro ekyo Omukama yanagire Abaamoni omu mikono ya Isiraeli, amugambira omu maisho g'Abaisiraeli ati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakama abo bontanu bairuka, besheleka Makeda omu mpako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagambira Yoshua bati, “Abakama abo bontanu aliho abashangire Makeda omu mpako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua agamba ati, “Muhilingise amabare gahango aha butahiro bw'empako, mugiteho abantu b'okubalinda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kyonkai inywe mutaikaraho. Mubinge ababisha, kandi abali enyuma mubaite. Mutabaikiliza kutaha mu bigo byabo, Omukama Ruhanga wanyu yababanagire omu mikono.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua n'Abaisiraeli baita muno Abaamori nk'abarabamaraho, n'orwo abandi bahungiire omu bigo byabo eby'eboma bakakira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisherukare bagaruka Makeda owa Yoshua omu rusisira eli milembe. Taliho muntu yagambire kigambo aha Baisiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Yoshua agamba ati, “Kingura empako munyihiremu abakama abo bontanu mubandetere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakora batyo; baihya abakama abo bontanu omu mpako babamuletera: Omukama wa Yerusalemu, owa Heburoni, owa Yarimuti, owa Lakishi n'owa Egiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kababaturukize bhakabamuletera, Yoshua ayeta Abaisiraeli bona abashaija, agambira abakuru b'abaisherukare ababaire batabaire nawe ati, “Ija mulibate abakama aba aha bikya.” Aho baija babalibata aha bikya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua abagambira ati, “Mutatina, mara mutahwahwana, mugume, mumanzare, aha rw'okuba nikwo Omukama aragira atyo ababisha banyu abo mulikurashanisa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma Yoshua tera abakama abo, abahanika aha miti etanu abaita. Basiba bahanikirwe aha miti egyo kugoba bwaigoro; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kyonkai omu kanya ak'eizoba lyaizire kutobera, Yoshua aragira kubahanantura aha miti kubanaga omu mpako eyo babaire beshelekiremu. Empako bagikingisa amabare gahango kuhika kuhika kir'eki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiro ekyo, Yoshua akwata ekigo kya Makeda, akitera, n'omukama wakyo amwisa embanda. Asilikiza kimoi abamwo bona, tiyasigireho n'omoi. Kandi omukama wa Makeda amukora nk'okwo yakozire owa Yeriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Yoshua n'Abaisiraeli bona, baraba Makeda kugya Libuna, bagitera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigo ekyo Ruhanga akinaga omu mikono ya Abaisiraeli, n'omukama wakyo kwakwo. Abaisiraeli baisa abamwo bona embanda, tiyasigiremu n'omoi. Kandi omukama wamwo amukora nk'okwo yakozire owa Yeriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua na Isiraeli yona, baraba Libuna bagya Lakishi, bagitanga embaju zona bagitera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha kiro kya kabili Omukama anaga ekigo kya Lakishi omu mikono ya Isiraeli, abamwo babaisa embanda nk'okwo baisire aba Libuna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Holamu omukama wa Gezeri atemba kujuna ekigo kya Lakishi. Yoshua amwita n'abaisherukarebe abamaraho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua araba Lakishi n'Abaisiraeli bona bagya Egiloni. Bagitanga embaju zona bagitera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kir'ekyo bagikwata, abamwo babaisa embanda. Bona ababaire bhalimu abasilikiza kimoi nk'okwo yakozire aba Lakishi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho baruga Egiloni bagya Heburoni; nayo bagitera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagikwata, abamwo n'omukama wabo babaisa embanda. Ebigo ebyabaire bigyataine nabyo babikwata, na buli omoi ayabaire halimu bamwita. Tiyasigireho n'omoi; okwo yakozire Egiloni nikwo yasilikize Heburoni, akaita buli muntu ayabaire halimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua n'Abaisiraeli bagaruka Debiri, nayo bagitera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagikwata n'omukama wayo n'ebigo ebyabaire bigyataine. Ababaire bhalimu babaisa embanda babasilikya. Tiyasigiremu n'omoi. Okwo yakozire Heburoni na Libuna n'omukama wayo nikwo yakozire Debiri n'omukama wayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo Yoshua asinga ensi yona, ensi z'amabanga n'eza Negebu n'ensi z'omuteleka n'ez'obusoka n'abakama bazo bona. Tiyasigiremu n'omoi. Abantu hakabaita bona nk'okwo Omukama Ruhanga wa Isiraeli yabaire ahangire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi agisinga yona kwema Kadeshibarinea kugoba Gaza, n'ensi yona ya Gosheni kugoba Gibeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwata abakama abo bona n'ensi zabo omu kanya kamoi, aha rw'enshonga Omukama Ruhanga wa Isiraeli akarashanira eihangalye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Yoshua n'Abaisiraeli bagaruka Giligali omu rusisira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
